REACTION   (48-CD-110(P,N)49-IN-110-G,,SIG,,,DERIV)
ANALYSIS   The contribution of 111Cd(p,2n)110In was subtracted.
            The cross section ratio of 110Cd(p,n)110In and
            111Cd(p,2n)110In was estimated using TALYS-1.95.
